# /function og:place (ops, on Anarchy): put the Black Market Dealer in the market, on the street outside the bank's door. Tagged crispy_shop
# (or the market moves it out) and needtag.blackmarket (only players wearing [Black Market], from the hidden anarchy:black_market advancement, can trade). The market's
# own spawn_shops/reinstall kills crispy_shop villagers, so run this again after one.
execute in crispy:market run forceload add -112 -80 -96 -60
execute in crispy:market run forceload add -64 56 -40 80
execute in crispy:market run kill @e[tag=crispy_ogshop]
execute in crispy:market run forceload remove -64 56 -40 80
